%% OpenLess client data flow — recording, streaming, persistence, and optional remote services
flowchart TD
    HOTKEY[Global hotkey / app action]
    COORD[Coordinator\npress / release / session owner]
    REC[Recorder\nPCM capture + bounded buffer]
    ENGINE[openless-core dictation engine]
    PREP[Provider preparation\nASR / LLM / local runtime]
    ASR[ASR provider]
    DELTA[Transcript deltas\nbackend:event]
    CAPSULE[Capsule WebView\nlevel / transcript / state]
    POLISH[LLM polish / translation]
    INSERT[Host insertion\nclipboard / accessibility / TSF]
    HISTORY[History + activity persistence]
    PREFS[Preferences + credential vault]
    SYNC[Encrypted sync\noptional]
    MARKET[Marketplace\nstyle pack fetch/import]
    MAIN[Main WebView\nsettings / history / style]

    HOTKEY --> COORD
    COORD -->|start / stop / cancel| ENGINE
    COORD -->|recording state| CAPSULE
    ENGINE --> REC
    ENGINE --> PREP
    REC -->|ordered PCM| ASR
    PREP --> ASR
    ASR -->|partial / final text| ENGINE
    ENGINE --> DELTA
    DELTA --> CAPSULE
    ENGINE --> POLISH
    POLISH -->|streaming output| DELTA
    POLISH --> INSERT
    ENGINE --> INSERT
    INSERT --> HISTORY
    ENGINE --> HISTORY
    MAIN --> PREFS
    PREFS --> COORD
    PREFS -. sync settings / credentials .-> SYNC
    MAIN -. list / install style packs .-> MARKET
    MARKET -. imported pack .-> PREFS
    HISTORY --> MAIN
